   1934  fcbe							; Phase 4 bank3 return pads ($FCC1-$FCDD): bank3 crunch bodies tail
   1935  fcbe							; `sta $1FF8 / jmp <here>` — the sta executes bank3-side; the 3-byte jmp
   1936  fcbe							; at +3 is FETCHED FROM THIS BANK post-switch (F6 pad rule), so each
   1937  fcbe							; `jmp <label>` image below must stay byte-identical with bank3.asm's
   1938  fcbe							; tail at the SAME address (dasm check_tramp_targets verifies the
   1939  fcbe							; bank3-side jmp operand against these labels). Slots 0-2 of each pad
   1940  fcbe							; are bank3-only (the sta) — never fetched bank2-side.
