   1955  fcf0							; HotOverlapBody — MOVED from bank0 (S5.3, kernel `jmp HotOverlapFlag` at
   1956  fcf0							; $FE80 tramp -> `jmp $FCF0` here). Fold-free: the hot-rect stream (RoomRects)
   1957  fcf0							; is level data in THIS bank, so the 7 `jsr FoldIndirect` become direct
   1958  fcf0							; `lda (FetchPtr),Y` (one less push level on the hot path too).
   1959  fcf0							; Behavior (full docs moved with the body): if the player's proposed tile
   1960  fcf0							; range (CollisionCell*) overlaps any hot-only rect, set Temp bit 7 (HotBump).
   1961  fcf0							; Called from PlayerHitsMap HIT while CollisionCell* still describe the
   1962  fcf0							; rejected position. Hot record = parent mask, x, y, w, h (5 B); parent mask
   1963  fcf0							; & BombPacked != 0 = that wall was blasted -> hot piece dead.
   1964  fcf0							; Contract: TAIL-CALLED from bank0 (`jmp`, 0 push) — every exit must return
   1965  fcf0							; C=1 to the ORIGINAL PlayerHitsMap caller. Exits therefore end
   1966  fcf0							; `sec / jmp $FBF8` (ReturnPad: sta $1FF6 switches to bank0, rts pops the
   1967  fcf0							; pre-tramp return address; sta touches neither A nor flags -> C survives).
