   2069  fd78							; Feature-record dispatch ($80 phase / $81 vcrunch / $82 hcrunch — Phase 4):
   2070  fd78							; armed/overlap/kill tests live in bank3 (HOVFeatEntry). $80 phase: b5 armed
   2071  fd78							; (staged by PhaseBlink each VBL) + candidate-box overlap → shared Hot hit
   2072  fd78							; (Temp b7 → bank0 `jsr LoseLife`); kill gated on armed-and-not-removed
   2073  fd78							; (`and #$60 / cmp #$20`), latches b6, PhaseBlink punch forced OFF while b6
   2074  fd78							; set (walls REMOVED, same-room only — EnterRoom zeroes the mask).
   2075  fd78							; $81 vcrunch: sprite shutter — the kill rides the OverlayTramp MISS path
   2076  fd78							; (OvShutTest/OvShutBand, MetaB b7 gate) because the punched cell never
   2077  fd78							; trips this walk. The record path (loop push + HOVFeatPre's 4 field pushes
   2078  fd78							; + bank3 jsr HOVvcrunch) measured SP=$F6 = real BombTimer ($F7) stomp
   2079  fd78							; (sim_bomb_fuse mirror stomp, 2026-10-13) — skip the record here.
   2080  fd78							; Entered with Y = record base + pushed Y (loop invariant), A = mask.
   2081  fd78							; 15B kept: the cmp/beq/jmp + pad replace the old tramp byte-for-byte —
   2082  fd78							; the BombEnemyBlastBody $FD87 pin (kernel tramp operand) must not move.
   2083  fd78				   .HOVfeature
   2084  fd78		       c9 81		      cmp	#$81
   2085  fd7a		       f0 ef		      beq	HOVnext	; vcrunch skip (HOVnext pops the loop Y)
   2086  fd7c		       4c fc fb 	      jmp	HOVFeatPre	; → pre-read fields (bank2 ROM) → bank3 dispatch
   2087  fd7f		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	8, 0	; pad: 2+2+3+8 = 15B = old body size
   2088  fd87
   2089  fd87							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2090  fd87							; BombEnemyBlast body — kill first live enemy |dcol| < 2 (any Y). Type check:
   2091  fd87							; LAMP (5) is NOT killable — the old inline loop set the dead bit on lamps too
   2092  fd87							; (lost lamp, no dark-room trigger, +50 score for nothing — bugs.md 3).
   2093  fd87							; Entered from bank0 stub (sta $1FF8 / jmp <here> — operand in kernel.asm,
   2094  fd87							; twin at $FDD8 below), 0 pushes; every exit `jmp $FBF8` ReturnPad.
   2095  fd87							; Out: A = 1 kill (caller awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none (Z set).
